usage: module-nav token [-h] [-n N] [--context [N]] [--module TOKEN_MODULE] word

positional arguments:
  word                  Token to search (e.g. setPreferredSize)

options:
  -h, --help            show this help message and exit
  -n N                  Max results to show (default 50)
  --context [N]         Show N surrounding source lines per match (bare flag = 2, omitted = 0
                        compact, N = custom window)
  --module, -m TOKEN_MODULE
                        Filter to a specific module
